    esma_mifirRts6a_2015 RegulatoryClassificationMifirRTS6a_2015 (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision 2024-12-12).">
    esma_mifirRts6b_2015 RegulatoryClassificationMifirRTS6b_2015 (0..1) <"DEPRECATED. Not in use (RPTWG decision 2024-12-12).">
